}}'''Bronze Gingerscythe''' is a [[Unique Weapons|unique]] knife obtained by finishing third on the gifting leaderboard during the [[Christmas Event 2023]]. 

== Appearance ==
It has the same mesh as the godly variant of [[Gingerscythe]], but it's color scheme has been altered to bronze-white colors.

== Trivia ==

* It has [[Silver Gingerscythe|silver]], [[Gold Gingerscythe|gold]] and [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Blue_Gingerscythe blue] variants, as well as it's [[Gingerscythe|EVO variant]].
* Like all the other [[Unique Weapons|unique weapons]] (Except [[Corrupt]]), this item is [[Trading|untradable]].
* The sole owner of this item is supposed to be '''[https://www.roblox.com/users/654712576/profile Luckyyloll].'''
** This item, however, was also given out to '''[https://www.roblox.com/users/3464083195/profile BigBoyCoobs]''', an MM2 Game Tester. This happened due to a leaderboard stats glitch, as '''BigBoyCoobs''' had won third place in the testing server. This glitch is yet to be fixed.
** Currently, this item is the only Top 3 Trophy item to have two separate owners.

